<title>BAHRAIN: Bahrain says 48.2 mln dinar trade surplus in Q4.</title>
<headline>Bahrain says 48.2 mln dinar trade surplus in Q4.</headline>
<dateline>MANAMA 1997-03-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bahrain posted a 48.2 million dinar trade surplus in the fourth quarter of 1996 after a 58.9 million dinar surplus in the third quarter, Bahrain Monetary Agency figures showed.</p>
<p>Data in millions of Bahraini dinars</p>
<p>		     Q4  96   Q3  96   Q2  96   Q1  96   Q4  95</p>
<p>  Total exports 471.00    421.60   418.80   419.10   409.50</p>
<p>    oil	    335.60   277.70   284.40   289.40   236.80</p>
<p>  non-oil*	 135.40   143.90   134.40   129.70   172.70</p>
<p>  Total imports 422.80    362.70   371.30   382.00   389.60</p>
<p>    oil	    189.60   149.50   164.70   167.00   128.80</p>
<p>  non-oil*	 233.20   213.20   206.60   215.00   260.80</p>
<p>  Trade balance  +48.2    +58.9    +47.5    +37.1    +19.9</p>
<p>*1996 provisional</p>
<p>$1 = 0.377 dinar</p>
</text>
